    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"110031\">Patrick Massot</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Riemannian.20bundles.20issues.20again/near/606061837\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Indeed digging out E seems to be mean misbehaving again. But the diamond still exists, right?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>What diamond? I don't think we don't have any diamond here.</p>",
