    {
        "content": "<p>What about <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Riemannian.20diamond/near/606013476\">#mathlib4 &gt; Riemannian diamond @ 💬</a> ?</p>",
